The surveys must reach the [[--missing]] report the same way they reach the
summary.
A passing exam must not hide an uncompleted survey, a completed survey is
never reported whatever its grade---nor is its grade ranked, which would fail
on a grade like [[50]]---and without a passing exam both rules fire: the
survey as mandatory, each exam as an option.
